WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.100
Hey, did you hear?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:11.110
Two kids from our school participating in the World Duel Carnival made it to the tournament finals.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.320
Ryoga-<i>sama</i> was a given, but I can't believe that kid also...

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.830
Yup, yup.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.330
Um, who was he again?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.120
That kid with the catchphrase...

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.290
- Um...
 - Um...

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:27.040
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.720
Wanna autograph?

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.390
I won't hesitate to give our autographs!

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.100
H-How about it?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.100
My autograph!

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.100
I'll give you my autograph!

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.810
Lemme autograph!

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.310
I'll autograph for you!

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:48.060
Isn't Tsukumo-<i>kun</i> getting a little full of himself?

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.270
Looks that way.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.730
That idiot.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:53.530
To summarize, he's a braggart.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.740
Hey, c'om, lemme autograph!

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:00.370
That hurts, hurts, hurts, <i>hurts</i>, Kotori!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Stop showing off!

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.210
Gosh...

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.040
You really are an idiot.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.420
But I made it all the way to the finals, you know.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.550
Let me enjoy myself a bit.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.130
Oh, that's right.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.260
Lookie here.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.380
Take a look at this!

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.010
Tada!

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.890
I got me an official invitation!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.270
The invitation to the Night Ceremony prior the Finals! It'll be held tonight at Heartland!

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.390
Eh?!

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.980
Amazing!

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.650
There's got to be a lot of Dueling celebrities attending!

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.110
Cat! What should I wear?

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:37.240
- This is exciting!
 - Hey! I'm the one who got invited!

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.240
I just thought of a great plan.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.910
I'm not gonna let Yuma hog all the enjoyment!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.000
<i>The strongest Duelists from around the world have gathered.</i>

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.670
<i>They've come to fight it out in the World Duel Carnival.</i>

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:59.180
<i>I beat many guys and finally qualified for the tournament finals!</i>

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.600
<i>I don't care how strong they are! Bring 'em!</i>

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.430
<i>I'm gonna win the championship!</i>

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.680
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:12.730
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:18.070
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.920
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:40.720
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:45.310
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:51.350
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:56.440
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:01.990
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:07.790
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:12.830
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:18.300
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:23.970
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.140
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:36.230
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.370
"Number 50: The Eve of the Storm!
 The Diabolical Duelist Appears - Tron!"

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.130
Wait, Tron.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.680
Strengthen me, just like you did with III!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.350
I'm disappointed in you and III.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.650
Wha...?!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.570
Why, you...!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.400
You know, III fought...

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.990
...against the Original Number and ended up like that!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.990
Like he is right now!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.530
I want <i>results</i>.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.910
If you guys are unable to do this, I have other options.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.710
Like Ryoga Kamishiro.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.880
I dragged him into this tournament for that purpose.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.050
Why...?

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.850
Why, Tron?!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:14.830
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.670
You're at your limit!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.250
If you use Photon Mode anymore to search for Numbers,

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.840
your recovery will take even longer!

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.800
<i>You're pushing yourself far too much.</i>

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.470
<i>You sure that's a good idea, Kaito?</i>

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.180
K-Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s body is...!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.970
As you can see, it's not a problem.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.520
<i>That's good to hear.</i>

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.690
<i>Now is the time to act, while the Numbers have been gathered in Heartland City.</i>

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.980
<i>We have high expectations for you, after all.</i>

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:43.990
I know that.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:47.150
But you better help Haruto as you promised.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.870
<i>Of course. You needn't worry about that.</i>

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.490
<i>Ah, that's right.</i>

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.830
<i>We'll be expecting you at tonight's ceremony.</i>

00:05:54.830 --> 00:06:00.290
<i>Getting a glimpse of the Number Users beforehand may not be a bad idea.</i>

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.410
Man, Heartland always looks so friggin' awesome!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.740
For real! It's so pretty!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.950
Cat!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.870
Kotori, you really went all out with that outfit.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.790
As they say, "Chickens need feathers, people need clothes."

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.340
Chicken?!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.340
Yours suits you well too, Cat-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.010
That Monster Cat cosplay of yours!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:48.670
Monster?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.260
What's your problem?!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:54.430
Stop it, you two. We managed to come to Heartland...

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.730
Heartland...

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.940
This place was built by Dr. Faker.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.480
A dreamland where everyone from children to adults can have fun.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.530
Children who live in poverty are treated with priority.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:15.410
When you think about it, such philosophy is praised worldwide.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.950
The total area is...

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.870
How did you know all that?

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.960
It seems that the Numbers obtained from III

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:25.920
contained the memory pieces of information about this world.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:30.380
I can’t help but to feel your top-to-bottom view has become even sharper…

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.850
This must be the party's assembly hall!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.560
To summarize, it's a red carpet!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.690
I kind of feel like a star.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.310
Meow, meow~!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.860
No means no!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.690
Those uninvolved are not permitted to enter!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.360
I got me an invitation right...

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.360
...here.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.370
As you see.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.500
It's gone!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.620
Yuma, you can't mean... again...?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:02.580
You lost it...

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.590
I already said that I'm a finalist!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:15.260
How can a kid like you be a finalist?

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.800
It's true!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.520
If so, show us your invitation!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.810
Well...

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.440
Now go on home.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.520
Everything has a flip side.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.190
Tokunosuke?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.860
I came up with an idea.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.950
That’s the female Duelist, Milky Kulala!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.250
Even red carpets have a flip side.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.080
I finally get the chance to wear a dress and it's ruined.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.000
Thank you!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:02.850
What the?!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.480
Shoot!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.150
Yuma-<i>kun</i>?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.020
Wait up!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.530
God, you really are an idiot!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.580
I'll utilize Yuma and those idiots.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.800
Please give me your autograph!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.630
I'm a fan of yours!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.720
It's someone who qualified for the tournament finals...

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:41.970
Hey, kid!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.680
I told you I'm...

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.560
You little prankster!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.810
I was wondering who it was, and it turned out to be Yuma Tsukumo.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.770
You're...

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.520
Gauche-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.690
You're making a big scene as always.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.860
What'd you do this time?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.530
Well, he came here without an invitation!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:02.330
It's fine. He may not look like it, but he's a final participant.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.990
Yes, but...

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.420
You feel like you can't believe me?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.880
N-No, sir...

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.590
Let's go.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.250
Yeah...

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.050
Whacha think? My mood's quite the...

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.670
A-Amazing...!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.340
That’s one of the finalists,

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.720
the Black Panther from the midst of South America, Garcia Panther!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:06.220
On that side, it’s the white-night noble, Beroman Sakata!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.560
A-And...

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.190
The Fallguys!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.520
During countless Duel Tournaments,

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:19.110
this Dark Trio pushed their opponents to the abyss of terror with their overwhelming might!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.780
Where's Shark?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.320
He's here, isn't he?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.370
Kaito!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.250
That's...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:34.340
<i>Yuma Tsukumo... You are Kazuma-</i>san<i>'s son, right?</i>

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.500
<i>Your dad is alive.</i>

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.050
<i>In the Astral World.</i>

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.430
That's quite unusual coming from you.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.810
Screw you!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.310
Why did you put Haruto through that...?!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.520
Even you're my former mentor…

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.070
...you won't forgive me, right?

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.320
Why...? Tell me why...

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.240
What is your goal?

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.120
We merely obey Tron's will.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.120
Tron...?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.950
You will meet him eventually.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.710
Don't tell me... he's in the finals?

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:21.170
Do you really think you'll defeat me and Tron with your body in this condition?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:39.980
They're gone...

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.280
I wanted to ask him something...

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.820
Okay, here you are.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.530
You're next, right?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.200
Yes!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.660
Fanservice is my motto, after all.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.630
Move!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.260
You're in my way!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.600
What's wrong?

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.900
Where's your usual insults?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.240
The time I've been waiting for is almost here.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:28.820
I will bet everything I have to defeat you!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.050
You look stressed.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.260
Droite...

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:56.100
I've been able to tell something's wrong with you for a while now.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.690
What are you talking about?

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.770
I received word from the medical room.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.860
Your body is already...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.360
You've got bad taste.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:08.320
It's unfortunate about Haruto.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:12.280
I know you have to collect Numbers at all costs.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.540
But...

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.500
You shouldn't enter the finals.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.790
I have no reason to listen to you.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:19.880
Kaito!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.290
V is in the finals...

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.510
He's now with this man named Tron who kidnapped Haruto.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.590
Kaito!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.260
Above all else, I won't...

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.640
...lose against that guy!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.100
I'm just thinking about you...

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:45.610
You showed me quite the night ceremony befitting what is to come.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.070
This is the fruit of our steadily progressing plan.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.780
Has the main cast been gathered?

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:55.120
All but one have shown up.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.080
Who is it?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.210
A Duelist disguising himself as Tron.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.330
Tron?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.830
Does that ring any bells?

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:03.790
No.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.800
Then I, as the representative of Heartland,

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:11.550
will deliver the reception speech to the finalists.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:21.020
To summarize, Tokunosuke-<i>kun</i> didn't come inside with all of us?

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.190
I don't see him anywhere.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.230
Could you be...?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:33.530
To summarize, you're the powerful Duelist, The Vampire of Dawn, Lord of Terror Nagashima!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:36.700
To summarize...

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.370
Please give me your autograph!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.420
The Class Rep loves collecting his autographs.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.760
Thank you very much!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.800
Flip the flip side!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.430
Flip?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.490
Heart Burning!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.620
Ladies and gentleman!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.660
And all present Duelists!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.960
Are you enjoying the party?!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.800
Starting tomorrow, the Duel Carnival finally reaches the Final!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:39.770
Please allow me to reintroduce the remaining 23 warriors!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:41.850
First...!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.910
Wha-What the?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.230
Ah, what a big cake!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.330
And y-you are...?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.790
I'm Tron!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.420
Call me Tron.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.040
Tron...

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.550
So that's...Tron?

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.930
Gramps...

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.470
What is it?

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.060
Is something the matter?

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:11.190
Gramps, I'm gonna...

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.690
...crush you guys into the ground!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.120
You know, I <i>love</i> cake!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.750
Say, the kid down there!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.040
Let's meet in the finals.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:48.270
You can see me, can't you?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.030
He's gone!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.120
What's going on?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.910
Eh? Where'd he go?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.080
He's gone!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.210
Just what is he...?

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.510
Over there! It's him! Him!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.260
My impostor!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.860
Shoot!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.110
You guys did it again, huh?!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.200
No we didn't!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.580
Damn you!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.880
To summarize, it was Tokunosuke-<i>kun</i>!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.260
So that's what he meant when he said flip the flip side!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.180
Hey! Wait up!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.020
I said you've got it wrong!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.460
Tron...

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.820
Is Haruto okay?

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.610
You have no reason to be worried about him.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:06.570
Just focus on settling the score with me.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.330
Kaito...

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.160
I will give it my all.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.830
Same here, man!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.410
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:17.540
I'm not going to give my all to defeat <i>you</i>.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.630
I meant <i>Astral</i>!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.760
Darn you!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.820
So you're going to hire us or something, right?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:43.530
Yes.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.900
We're expensive.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:50.830
Then we'll start with a small deposit.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:53.040
The rest comes when you complete your job.

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:56.870
And the target is...?

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.500
A boy named Yuma Tsukumo.

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:03.630
Got 'em!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:21.230
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:31.950
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.390
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:21.830
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.520
The Duel Carnival Tournament Finals have finally begun!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:47.110
It’s the final battle between the strongest Duelists who qualified for the Final!

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:48.940
Wait, Duel Coasters?!

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:51.320
Wow, sounds like fun!

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.360
Be careful.

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:55.160
There might be some unknown strong opponents among them!

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:57.040
Huh? It's gone!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.700
My Heart Pieces are gone!

00:23:58.700 --> 00:24:00.330
Yuma, it's coming!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:06.210
"Here we come, Tournament Finals! Duel Coasters, Go!"

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:08.300
A three-on-one Duel?!

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:14.180
Today we're introducing Heroic Champion Excalibur!

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:16.140
Its effect doubles its Attack Power.

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:17.560
It can save you in a pinch.

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:18.850
Then I got no need for it!

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:21.350
Have you forgotten the time you and Kaito were in a pinch?

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:23.230
I'll permit a Tsukumo Pinch!

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:24.190
Like heck I will!
